      "rationale": "Capability palette for answer_mode. Combined with R4b by plain intersection it yields the effective behaviour: `ask_before_answering` is admitted only when capability is ask_clarification or uncertainty_handling AND input_condition is clean, missing_info, conflicting_constraints or ambiguous. Consequently missing_info and conflicting_constraints are reachable only on those two capabilities, and ask_clarification has no legal answer_mode on input_condition=irrelevant_details (see reachability.zero_solution_pairs). Analytical capabilities (comparison, reasoning, planning, decision_analysis, data_analysis, debugging) use structured_analysis. An assignment is legal iff it satisfies every constraint; there is no priority or scoping mechanism."
