      "rationale": "Input-condition rule set for answer_mode, combined with R4a by plain intersection. Effective behaviour: `ask_before_answering` is admitted only when capability is ask_clarification or uncertainty_handling AND input_condition is clean, missing_info, conflicting_constraints or ambiguous. missing_info and conflicting_constraints admit only ask_before_answering, so they are reachable only on {ask_clarification, uncertainty_handling}; the other 18 capabilities have no legal combination on them (see reachability.zero_solution_pairs). clean additionally admits ask_before_answering so that ask_clarification / uncertainty_handling can ask on clean input. irrelevant_details admits explain_then_answer alongside direct_answer and structured_analysis, so explanation and uncertainty_handling become reachable there; ask_clarification remains unreachable on irrelevant_details. ambiguous admits ask or explain; edge_case admits structured_analysis or explain. There is no capability-side exception mechanism: this rule set and R4a are combined by plain intersection.",
      "relaxations_vs_previous_round": [
        {
          "from_value": "clean",
          "added": "ask_before_answering",
          "reason": "clean input may still warrant a clarifying question from ask_clarification / uncertainty_handling"
        },
        {
          "from_value": "irrelevant_details",
          "added": "explain_then_answer",
          "reason": "ignoring irrelevant details does not forbid explaining"
        }
