      "rationale": "visual_domain is a modality-conditional axis, not a 12th universal axis. must_support_image = capabilities whose core task is image content (recognition, OCR, chart/diagram reading, summarisation, structured extraction). may_support_image = capabilities that work on images but do not require them. text_only = capabilities whose payload is pure text/tool arguments. Policy is a capability-side declaration: it says what a sample is allowed to pair with, not which samples must exist."
    },
