      "rationale": "Domain, output language, response style, difficulty and input length are independent content/instruction dimensions: every value combines with every value of every other axis. Declaring this explicitly prevents the implicit-convention defect that R1-R6 fix and makes the 209 knowledge-domain leaves fully covered without enumerating 209 x N pairs."
